{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43476","headline":"寿星见 · 无名氏","name":"寿星见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄象今何应，时和政亦平。\n祥爲一人寿，色映九霄明。\n皎洁垂银汉，光芒近斗城。\n合规同月满，表瑞得天清。\n甘露盈条降，祥烟向日生。\n无如此嘉祉，率土荷秋成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}